\cf2\b\fs24 Should I Comply With The Purity Standard?\par
\cf1\b0\f0\fs20 should still function in every supported Java environment. \ldblquote Common\par
behavior\rdblquote  does not mean identical behavior, but functional behavior\par
conformant with the underlying platform.\par
For more information about portability, see Chapter 2, "Understanding\par
Portability & Purity".\par
